Jim holds up a chalkboard that says five days and Dwight erases it and writes in the number six.
吉姆举起一块写着五天的黑板，德怀特把它擦掉，写上了数字六。

843
00:38:36.780 --> 00:38:39.660
They're very serious about the no-nonsense.
他们对这种严谨认真非常严肃。

844
00:38:40.420 --> 00:38:43.260
Now Jim is going to join Pam at their desk clump.
现在吉姆要加入潘所在的办公桌群了。

845
00:38:43.260 --> 00:38:47.520
And he's going to say the pre-conference room meeting went well, which bodes well for the
他要说会前会议进展顺利，这预示着

