That was good and it was not my soapbox.
挺好的，而且我也没在发表高谈阔论。

885
00:40:24.960 --> 00:40:25.360
Okay.
好吧。

886
00:40:25.600 --> 00:40:26.920
So here's what I have to say.
那我有话要说。

887
00:40:27.240 --> 00:40:32.760
It's not that Jim almost lost Pam because he went to athlete.
吉姆差点失去帕姆，并不是因为他去了“运动员”公司。

888
00:40:33.160 --> 00:40:40.640
Jim almost lost Pam because he was dishonest and sneaky and non-communicative and made decisions
吉姆差点失去帕姆，是因为他不诚实、鬼鬼祟祟、不愿沟通，还在不听取她意见的情况下

