And now all they've done is swing too far in the opposite direction.
而现在他们所做的，只是矫枉过正，走向了另一个极端。

891
00:40:46.980 --> 00:40:50.000
What this couple needs is to communicate.
这对伴侣需要的是沟通。

892
00:40:50.000 --> 00:40:51.380
And grow up.
还有成熟起来。

893
00:40:51.380 --> 00:40:53.160
Yes, exactly.
是的，完全如此。

894
00:40:53.960 --> 00:41:00.120
Jim is allowed to start a business and Pam is allowed to feel overwhelmed and lonely.
吉姆有权创业，帕姆也有权感到不知所措和孤独。

895
00:41:00.380 --> 00:41:04.960
And there is a way that they could do this all if they would just talk to each other
其实只要他们多沟通，

