Well, interestingly enough, this was a candy bag joke.
这并不是原本剧本里的笑话。

938
00:42:49.560 --> 00:42:51.880
This was not the originally scripted joke.
真有意思。

939
00:42:51.880 --> 00:42:52.520
Interesting.
吉姆说这显然是废话。

940
00:42:52.980 --> 00:42:55.020
Well, Jim says that's obviously nonsense.
我们办公室对废话的容忍度是百分之多少？

941
